                    <b>FullWidth</b> / <b>FullSize</b> for 100%, <b>FitHeight</b> / <b>FitWidth</b> /
                    <b>FitSize</b> for fit-content, and <b>AutoHeight</b> / <b>AutoWidth</b> / <b>AutoSize</b>
